# Sound sources, deliberately uncommitted.
# sounds/*.wav are the Augmentinel Amiga rips (~12 MB) — source material, not a shipping asset;
# public/sounds/*.m4a is what ships and what is committed.
# sounds/candidates/ is generated by utils/gen-sounds.py, whose seeded RNG is deterministic
# (verified: regeneration is byte-identical), so it is rebuildable rather than stored.
